{"overview":"در یک بیمارستان شلوغ نیویورک، هر روز می‌تواند به زندگی یا مرگ منجر شود، اما برای پرستار جکی این ساده‌ترین بخش است؛ او با درد مزمن کمر و زندگی شخصی‌ای که در آستانه فروپاشی است، باید با دروغ‌های سفید، قوانین خمیده و استراتژی‌های مخفی، درد را کاهش داده و یک قدم جلوتر از فاجعه بماند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Every day is a matter of life and death in a hectic New York City hospital, but for Nurse Jackie that's the easiest part. Between chronic back pain that won't quit, and a personal life on the constant edge of collapse, it's going to take a white lie here, a bent rule there, and a handful of secret strategies to relieve the pain, and stay one step ahead of total disaster.","tagline_en":"Never go down easy.","runtime":30,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":30,"y":null,"poster":"/er6AIIKr4qRMBiKdF2UM4gzrZWg.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":12,"y":2009,"poster":"/cQcVeBZpDZO4x0FrPTKYiNT8WjY.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":12,"y":2010,"poster":"/v13n0Gg44gRUaA1DBLs9wp3Cs5g.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":12,"y":2011,"poster":"/ovgxVeuE5QHcW8MbJKUFbMSDGq9.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":10,"y":2012,"poster":"/zrSYMR8xKkfmk4EPS8pnMsD8t6E.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":10,"y":2013,"poster":"/modLXjFvV1yDnFOvZXbwbWNTSkj.jpg"},{"n":6,"name":"فصل 6","ep":12,"y":2014,"poster":"/wQnS3fJglOit3bWRJdt2a0aUu65.jpg"},{"n":7,"name":"فصل 7","ep":12,"y":2015,"poster":"/sa5UVSAjwM13TYRnPtNlpnLkEhP.jpg"}],"episodes":80,"crew":["Linda Wallem","Liz Brixius","Evan Dunsky"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["GB","US"],"cast":[{"name":"ادی فالکو","role":"Jackie Peyton","photo":"/jS2Hnr5OmntpX0J7EpH70zAG0mz.jpg","en":"Edie Falco"},{"name":"مریت ویور","role":"Zoey Barkow","photo":"/ldd1WntzQ72DVuNLoko8yMFHH7j.jpg","en":"Merritt Wever"},{"name":"Paul Schulze","role":"Eddie Walzer","photo":"/rT7RXbJ89XwIKmSkymEE4BhyIlk.jpg"},{"name":"Dominic Fumusa","role":"Kevin Peyton","photo":"/1wgHvqNM0LisAhkInYDD9JIGPJ0.jpg"},{"name":"Anna Deavere Smith","role":"Gloria Akali